---
globs: apps/web/src/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow the Svelte state and chart contracts in `AGENTS.md`.

- Use TypeScript and the existing shadcn-svelte components under `$lib/components/ui`.
- Combine conditional Tailwind classes with `cn` from `$lib/utils`.
- Use the semantic color tokens in `apps/web/src/app.css`.
- Keep component filenames lowercase with hyphens and imported component names PascalCase.
- Keep the deployment adapters and database-driver selection in `apps/web/vite.config.ts`.
